1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Can you spot the mistake? AI training tests check for exactly this.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,500
An AI explains compound interest to a kid: one hundred dollars at ten percent, compounded every year.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,500
It says after two years, you'll have one hundred twenty dollars.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:18,500
Wrong. Year one, you get to one-ten. Year two, you earn ten percent of one-ten. That's one twenty-one.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,000
One twenty is simple interest. The exact thing it was supposed to explain the difference from.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,500
On these tests, a friendly answer with a wrong number loses. Accuracy beats style.

7
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,500
Follow for more practice questions before your real test.
